infinite-patch 1
# Audio Effects: shape the sound
node 1 Notes Random Note Generator
  id notes
  pos 0 156
end
node 2 Synths Analog
  id synth
  pos 480 302
end
node 3 AudioEffects Delay
  id echo
  pos 1340 318
end
node 4 AudioEffects Reverb
  id room
  pos 1960 318
end
node 5 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
  pos 2580 156
end
node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text Audio effects change a sound. Wire them in a row between the synth and the speakers.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 7 Compositing Comment
  pos 1340 156
  s text Delay repeats the sound. Try Feedback for more repeats and Mix for how loud they are.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 8 Compositing Comment
  pos 1960 156
  s text Reverb makes the sound feel like it is in a room. Try Size and Decay.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 9 Compositing Comment
  pos 480 156
  s text Effects sit between the sound and the speakers, in order.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
note synth 0 notes
aud echo 0 synth
aud room 0 echo
aud speakers 0 room
